    <h2>Daily Missions Services</h2>
    <h3 id="resume_streak">Resume a Streak</h3>
    <p>As the name suggests, this service allows you to resume a DM's streak. For example, if you have a long streak of completed DMs and then missed or failed a DM, you can use this service to resume your streak and continue from your last completed DM.</p>
    <p>The good thing is, it doesn't matter how much time has passed since you broke your streak, you will always be able to resume it - even if you broke it, say, a year before.<br />This service can be purchased in advance and activated when needed. There is no limit to how many of these cards you can purchase or own.</p>
    <p>You can purchase this service directly on the DM page: as soon as you break your streak a button will appear to the left of your "Day 1" DM, prompting you to buy it (or use it, if you already own at least one).</p>
    <AssetSlot Name="help-dm-resume-buy" Width="700" Height="200" />
    <p>Alternatively, you can purchase it from the <a href="/store">Store</a>.</p>
    <p>Once purchased you will be able to use this service directly on the DM page:</p>
    <AssetSlot Name="help-dm-resume-use" Width="700" Height="200" />
